README - NeoCell v3.4 Technology Files
======================================
This is a brief definintion of the NeoCell Technology files:
gpdk180.NeoDisplay -- contains stipple pattern and colors for layers.
gpdk180.NeoDefault -- defines layer configurations for the NeoCell router such as via/contact styles, 
                      and placer defaults.
gpdk180.NeoMap     -- Used by the NeoCell constraint editor to display generator parameters.
gpdk180.NeoTech    -- Equivalent to the CDN technology file, contains layer info, and DRC/ERC info.


NeoCell technology file usage setup info:
=========================================
(1) tclrc_gpdk  - this file contains the default multiplier used to convert to nanometers and should be 
                  placed/renamed either in the users
                  home directory as follows:
                  ~/.neolinear/tclrc or for 
                  site-specific usage as follows:
                  $NEOHOME/lib/init.local.tcl
(2) .cdsinit    - please include the following line within your working directory .cdsinit:
                  neoSpiceTerminals = "auCdl" or "auLvs"
                  this line is used by the NeoCell module generators to determine the pinning for devices.

